          "index": 1,
          "text": "Tan, Y. (2025). [6] Sales data on social media platforms exhibit characteristics of high dimensionality, strong nonlinearity, and multiple cycles. Traditional time series models (such as ARIMA and SARIMA) can handle trends and seasonal changes, but their eﬀectiveness is limited when dealing with complex variable interactions. Over the years, DL methods based on recurrent neural networks have become mainstream.",
